thing. Nothing else moves: the peak stays below the unchanged 5.0 m main-wall head, and the dormer plan extent, the light, the lower sash, the connector, the turned range, the main block, the footprint and the world placement are untouched. The shoulder roof silhouette and the left group's relative proportions remain OPEN on T-2376."
